# U52: the Similar Builds popup (Build.lua:1576-1614, U20's popup with U52's hook entry) with the
# list's draw body run on both sides. Init POSTs importCode=<the build code> to
# /api/recommendations (the recorded response: HTTP 200, two builds with a "Match Score"); the
# list shows them with the metadata line. Then: hover the provider dropdown, open it and pick its
# only entry again (DropDownControl:SetSel calls selFunc only for another index, so Init does not
# run again; the Rust unit test `init_again_keeps_a_focused_control_until_it_loses_focus` covers
# that with two providers), Preview of the first build (OpenURL), the wheel (the content fits:
# the scroll bar stays disabled).
#! u52-setup similar
#! u52-draw-body
#! expect-text Similar Necromancer
#! expect-text Match Score: 0.9312
#! u52-expect-post https://pobarchives.com/api/recommendations importCode=eN
#! u52-expect-effect open-url https://pobarchives.com/build/sm1
fixture userdir=../../fixtures/user1
fixture net=net.json
frames 3
move 840 116
frames 1
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 1
move 840 134
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 3
move 450 290
frames 1
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 1
move 640 400
wheel down 2
frames 2
